From 06815b3347a0f067053501a28a943d05d88b403d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 22:20:51 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] reaper v1.9.6: dashboard client-list + USB poll + security
 posture; Warden country checkboxes; Features row

Batch of owner-requested UI items:
- Dashboard client list: brighter/larger detail text (steel 11px -> bone-dim 12px,
  mono -> bone), more card contrast - the grey/small rows were hard to read.
- Dashboard USB: get_usb_info() is server-rendered ONCE at load, but USB mounts
  ~40-50s into boot, so a fresh boot showed no USB. renderUsb() is now re-callable
  and a boot poll re-fetches /appGet.cgi?hook=get_usb_info() every 5s for ~90s,
  populating the tiles + storage ring without a manual reload.
- Security posture: added Gatekeeper (gk_enable) + Warden (rwarden_enable) rows to
  the posture card (RGK_00/RWDN_00 names, RDSH_85/86 subs; enabled=ok, off=warn).
- Warden country block: replaced the multi-select listbox with a searchable
  checkbox grid (rwBuildGeo -> checkboxes, rwGeoFilter live filter, save reads
  checked; unknown-code preservation kept). New RWDN_53 'Filter countries'.
- System Info Features row (rc_support): advertise Reaper's own new packages -
  gatekeeper, warden, reaper_devices, reaper_storage, rwatch - alongside the
  existing reaper/reaper_traffic/hwqos_classful/reaper_mcp (init.c reaper block).
  NOTE: stale-looking cloud tokens (account_binding/nordvpn/dns_dpi/tor) are
  #ifdef-gated on flags STILL compiled in, so they reflect present features;
  'eula' is load-bearing (Captive-Portal guest terms). Actually removing those
  features is a separate de-bloat pass, not a Features-row edit - left for owner.
- RDSH_85/86 + RWDN_53 English-seeded into all 25 dicts (lockstep).
